This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the OWASP Mobile Application Security Verification Standard (MASVS) as a
grounded IDD graph so consuming projects can compose it with throughline-compose.

The MASVS itself is published by the OWASP Foundation under CC BY-SA 4.0. The
requirement text reproduced here in items' `text`/`rationale`/`attrs.source_ref` is
derived from MASVS and remains the work of the OWASP Foundation and its contributors;
this repository claims no ownership over that content and reproduces it, under the same
CC BY-SA 4.0 terms, for interoperability. See https://github.com/OWASP/masvs for the
authoritative source.
